g_risk_001","missing_source_classes":["IB","非临床毒理学报告","既往临床安全性数据","类效应安全性数据"],"target":"8.3 研究药物相关风险"}],"heading":"研究药物相关风险","missing_source_classes":["研究者手册（IB）含KZ-617已知/潜在风险、非临床毒理学摘要、既往人体暴露数据","KZ-617非临床毒理学研究报告（含安全药理学、重复给药毒性、遗传毒性）","KZ-617既往临床试验（如有）安全性报告","P2X3受体拮抗剂类药物的类效应安全性数据"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"研究药物相关风险章节需要KZ-617片的具体风险特征，包括：已知或潜在不良反应（味觉障碍以外的特异性信号）、非临床毒理学发现（如靶点相关毒性、脱靶效应）、既往人体暴露中的安全性信号、与P2X3/P2X2/3通道相关的理论风险、以及基于上述信息确定的重点监测项目。项目研究定义仅提及'重点描述味觉障碍、口干、头痛等不良事件'作为次要目的中的安全性关注点，但未提供这些风险的发生率、严重程度、与剂量的关系或机制依据。缺少IB、非临床报告及既往临床数据，无法形成有实质信息的风险描述。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（研究药物相关风险）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_d828e848b004_5d0a0b9934274de2","section_number":"8.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:da1333f4dbece06a51cffd15","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:r7:5f50b13d370ad80e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3f194f5112122b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:5cb5f7385bb976"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261004055151_3cf3fca1","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"获取本项目AE采集与记录规程、安全性评估计划及eCRF规范后撰写正文","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_ae_collection_001","missing_source_classes":["项目AE采集规程","安全性评估计划","eCRF设计文档","安全性随访方案"],"target":"8.4 不良事件的采集与记录"}],"heading":"不良事件的采集与记录","missing_source_classes":["项目专属不良事件采集与记录规程（含TEAE窗口、AE分级、因果关系判定）","安全性评估计划（含各访视检查项目与时间窗）","eCRF设计文档或数据采集规范","本项目安全性随访方案（末次给药后2周的具体评估内容）"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"不良事件采集与记录章节需要项目专属的TEAE采集窗口定义（从首次给药至末次给药后多少天）、安全性评估访视时点及内容、AE分级标准（CTCAE版本）、因果关系判定方法、eCRF记录规范、随访要求及数据职责分工。项目研究定义列出安全性终点包含TEAE/SAE、味觉功能问卷、客观味觉测试、实验室、心电图、生命体征，但未定义采集窗口、各访视具体检查项目、AE记录格式或随访流程。公司语料中CMS-D017Ⅰ期方案提及'可溯源的参与者病历及严重不良事件报告表'及妊娠报告规则，但该来源为跨项目（非KZ-617）、跨分期（Ⅰ期vsⅡ期）的共享语料，按规则不得迁移为本项目AE采集规则。不得由访视日推断实验室检查、心电图、体格检查在每个访视均实施。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_d828e848b004_c48d3bb101de9201","section_number":"8.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:da1333f4dbece06a51cffd15","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:r7:5f50b13d370ad80e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3f194f5112122b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:5cb5f7385bb976"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"98b85c70ff690abde9fe3573e72575177796d238d8b83b7d41cb7f87ba8c9f1f","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_d828e848b004_4599f7b526b2bbc8:full-draft:da1333f4dbece06a51cffd15","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:da1333f4dbece06a51cffd15","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:09cd7d7ba68f642e5a3799055ef3721896a55a46dc138ed6e990460233b2997e:da1333f4dbece06a51cffd15","text_sha256":"98b85c70ff690abde9fe3573e72575177796d238d8b83b7d41cb7f87ba8c9f1f"},{"content_sha256":"766189fa02dc7f84e587aa9cf712b9c03ef3f504177110092d01762943dd5d6b","locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:revision:7","role":"confirmed_project_facts","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:r7:5f50b13d370ad80e","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","source_version":"mwdefinition_888686c1310a849fa905:r7:5f50b13d370ad80e","text_sha256":"766189fa02dc7f84e587aa9cf712b9c03ef3f504177110092d01762943dd5d6b"},{"content_sha256":"b527389c6837e6dd4863af7a361b384dfb01d86299c56b1917d11bc0534851fc","locator":"section:应提供的安全信息资料及要求|block:796|chunk:1","role":"company_sop_or_protocol_reference","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3f194f5112122b","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","source_version":"3f194f5112122b","text_sha256":"b527389c6837e6dd4863af7a361b384dfb01d86299c56b1917d11bc0534851fc"},{"content_sha256":"47df0c8